  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ???
    - Case #1
    - Middle Man
    - Case #1
    - Case #1
    - Middle Man
    - ???
    sentences:
    - THE TRIALS OF THIS SOUL SHALL COMMENCE...
    - Uhm.. Hello.. Nice to meet you, I'd like to tell my story!! I-if you don't
      mind..
    - Go On..
    - 'It all began in 1987, It was quite the year to be honest..

      Id hate
      it to happen again to me all of those things...'
    - Blah-blablah! Blah, Blah blah. Blablablah. Blabla? BLALBBLABLBALBLABLA!, Blabla.
      Blablabalbala. blablabla.
    - I've heard enough. It is time for your trial...
    - The time is now for the trials.. You will choose either the path of Justice,
      or.. the path of Judgement..
